1
00:00:00,094 --> 00:00:01,124
(Leonard:)What do you say?

2
00:00:01,128 --> 00:00:03,428
(Sheldon:)I get to write a contract?

3
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:05,800
(Sheldon:)I say, let's get this party
of the first part started!

4
00:00:12,606 --> 00:00:14,706
(Penny(after Amy laughs):)Do you really think
that's funny?

5
00:00:14,708 --> 00:00:16,808
(Amy:)It's in our agreement.
I have to laugh.

6
00:00:22,462 --> 00:00:24,662
(Sheldon:)If you find this
draft acceptable,

7
00:00:24,664 --> 00:00:27,764
(Sheldon:)then I believe your new
Relationship Agreement

8
00:00:27,767 --> 00:00:29,537
(Sheldon:)is ready to be signed.

9
00:00:29,535 --> 00:00:31,305
Article 8, subsection B:

10
00:00:31,304 --> 00:00:33,704
(Penny:)Leonard will restrict
video-gaming in underpants

11
00:00:33,706 --> 00:00:35,606
(Penny:)to hours Penny is not home.

12
00:00:35,608 --> 00:00:38,008
(Penny:)This includes boxers,
briefs, thongs, G-strings

13
00:00:38,011 --> 00:00:39,741
(Penny:)or anything else
that calls attention

14
00:00:39,746 --> 00:00:41,546
(Penny:)to his pasty little thighs.

15
00:00:45,885 --> 00:00:47,315
(Leonard:)Does it really need to say that?

16
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:50,760
(Sheldon:)I did this for free,
let me get a little something.

17
00:00:52,025 --> 00:00:54,325
Article 10, subsection C:

18
00:00:54,327 --> 00:00:56,927
(Leonard:)If questioned, Penny
may not say that everything

19
00:00:56,929 --> 00:00:58,729
(Leonard:)is fine if it isn't.

20
00:00:58,731 --> 00:01:01,301
(Leonard:)Other unacceptable responses
include: "It's nothing,"

21
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:03,900
"Don't worry about it,"
and "I said it's nothing,

22
00:01:03,903 --> 00:01:06,733
don't worry about it."

23
00:01:06,739 --> 00:01:08,739
(Penny:)I think this all looks good.

24
00:01:08,741 --> 00:01:10,211
(Leonard:)Me, too.

25
00:01:10,209 --> 00:01:11,409
(Sheldon:)Oh, well. Great,
then. Here.

26
00:01:11,411 --> 00:01:14,441
(Sheldon:)You sign here, date here.

27
00:01:14,447 --> 00:01:16,747
(Sheldon:)And, Penny, if you could
initial here to indicate

28
00:01:16,749 --> 00:01:19,549
(Sheldon:)that you're accepting Leonard
in "as is" condition.

29
00:01:26,692 --> 00:01:30,362
Aw. I remember signing our first
Relationship Agreement.

30
00:01:30,362 --> 00:01:32,762
(Sheldon:)Mm. You seem to be forgetting
the "no nostalgia" clause.

31
00:01:32,765 --> 00:01:57,985
(Amy:)Right, right. Got it.

